  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Sprint Retrospective</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Product Context:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Product Name]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Completed Cycle ID:</textStyle></bold> Sprint [Insert Number, e.g., 24]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Date of Review:</textStyle></bold> May 28, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Facilitator:</textStyle></bold> [Scrum Master Name]\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Sprint Metrics & Completion Telemetry\n2.1 Story Point Burndown Results\n2.2 Column Movement Overview\n3. Team Feedback Matrix (Core Quadrants)\n3.1 What We Did Well\n3.2 Areas for Improvement\n4. Sprint Bottlenecks & Root Cause Analysis\n4.1 Core Blockages Investigated\n5. Continuous Improvement Action Plan\n5.1 Next-Cycle Action Items\n<bold>2. Sprint Metrics & Completion Telemetry</bold>\n<bold>2.1 Story Point Burndown Results</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Sprint Point Commitment:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., 28 Story Points]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Points Successfully Delivered:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., 25 Story Points]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Spillover Points:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., 3 Story Points transferred to next cycle backlog]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Code Coverage Metrics:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., 82.5% Automated Pass Rate]\n<bold>2.2 Column Movement Overview</bold>\nTask velocity metrics traced across our short-cycle pipeline delivery board:\n[ Sprint Backlog: 8 Tickets ] ➔ [ In Progress: 0 ] ➔ [ Review / Testing: 1 ] ➔ [ Done ✓: 7 ]\n<bold>3. Team Feedback Matrix (Core Quadrants)</bold>\n<bold>3.1 What We Did Well</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">WIP Limit Adherence:</textStyle></bold> Keeping a maximum of 2 active tickets per person in the <code>In Progress</code> column stopped multitasking and helped close tickets faster.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Streaming Parser Deployment:</textStyle></bold> Replacing legacy loading arrays with the new chunk streaming model resolved all container memory warnings (<code>ST-201</code>).\n<bold>3.2 Areas for Improvement</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Mid-Sprint Dependency Blocks:</textStyle></bold> Frontend development on the upload progress bar (<code>ST-202</code>) stalled because backend endpoint specs were documented late.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Staging Access Delays:</textStyle></bold> The environment infrastructure setup was blocked for 24 hours while waiting for updated security configuration keys.\n<bold>4. Sprint Bottlenecks & Root Cause Analysis</bold>\n<bold>4.1 Core Blockages Investigated</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Identified Bottleneck:</textStyle></bold> Completed pull requests sat in the <code>Review / Testing</code> column for an average of 2.8 days.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Root Cause Analysis:</textStyle></bold> Developers focused entirely on writing code for their own active sprint tasks, bypassing the peer code review queue until the end of the sprint.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Agreed Process Adjustment:</textStyle></bold> The team will implement a mandatory 15-minute code review triage session immediately following morning standups.\n<bold>5. Continuous Improvement Action Plan</bold>\n<bold>5.1 Next-Cycle Action Items</bold>\nThese tasks will be injected into the next cycle board backlog during our upcoming sprint planning session:\nTargeted Process Action Item\nAssigned Owner\nPriority\nTaxonomy Tag\nTarget Deadline\n<italic>[Schedule daily morning PR triage]</italic>\n[Scrum Master]\nHigh\n<code>spike</code>\n[Insert Date]\n<italic>[Draft mockup endpoints before coding]</italic>\n[Developer 1]\nMedium\n<code>story</code>\n[Insert Date]\n<italic>[Automate environment key updates]</italic>\n[Engineering Lead]\nHigh\n<code>spike</code>\n[Insert Date]",
